--- !u!114 &599781264
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 599781262}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 286b4216db884fc198cab5d296bbc9cc, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Note
  title: Pognieciona kartka
  text: "Dzie\u0144 34.\n\nJe\u015Bli kto\u015B to czyta \u2013 NIE BIEGAJ. To co\u015B s\u0142yszy kroki.\nKucanie (Ctrl) jest ciche. Latarka (F) pomaga, ale wida\u0107 ci\u0119 z daleka \u2013 i nie \u015Bwie\u0107 NA NIEGO.\n\nSzafki ratuj\u0105 \u017Cycie (E). Je\u015Bli zacznie w\u0119szy\u0107 przy twojej \u2013 wstrzymaj oddech (Spacja).\nAle je\u015Bli zobaczy, jak do niej wchodzisz...\n\nPod sufitem biegn\u0105 grube rury. Ono w nich chodzi \u2013 s\u0142ycha\u0107 stukanie, a rury dr\u017C\u0105.\nTwoja kamera wci\u0105\u017C dzia\u0142a. Ma noktowizj\u0119 (PPM, potem F). Ono jej nie widzi.\n\nZostawi\u0142em wykrywacz ruchu niedaleko st\u0105d. Radiostacja w biurze kierownika jeszcze dzia\u0142a.\nTu nie ma zasi\u0119gu. Tylko ona mo\u017Ce nas st\u0105d wyci\u0105gn\u0105\u0107.\n\n- K."
  titleEn: Crumpled note
  textEn: "Day 34.\n\nIf anyone reads this \u2013 DON'T RUN. That thing hears footsteps.\nCrouching (Ctrl) is quiet. The flashlight (F) helps, but it can see you from far away \u2013 and don't shine it AT IT.\n\nLockers save lives (E). If it starts sniffing at yours \u2013 hold your breath (Space).\nBut if it sees you getting in...\n\nThick pipes run under the ceiling. It moves inside them \u2013 you can hear knocking, and the pipes shake.\nYour camera still works. It has night vision (RMB, then F). It can't see the camera's light.\n\nI left a motion tracker not far from here. The radio in the manager's office still works.\nThere's no signal down here. Only the radio can get us out.\n\n- K."
  paper: {fileID: 1682433836}
